OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies cannot return home after 
OL,4,Aexplosives found                       
OL,6,FPeople are not expected to be able to  
OL,7,Freturn to their homes while police     
OL,8,Fcontinue a search of a house where     
OL,9,Fexplosives were discovered.            
OL,11,FA bomb disposal unit was sent to       
OL,12,FShelley Grove in Droylsden, Tameside,  
OL,13,Fon Wednesday after the discovery made  
OL,14,Fduring an "unrelated investigation".   
OL,16,FA man in his 70s and a woman in her 60s
OL,17,Fwere arrested on suspicion of          
OL,18,Funlawfully possessing ammunition and   
OL,19,Fexplosive substances, and a 20-year-old
OL,20,Fman was held on criminal damage, arson 
OL,21,Fand possession of ammunition. They have
OL,22,Fall since been bailed.                 
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
