OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies cannot return home after 
OL,4,Aexplosives found                       
OL,6,FGreater Manchester Police said searches
OL,7,Fwould continue over the weekend, and   
OL,8,Fthat people living within the cordon   
OL,9,Fwere "unable to return to their homes".
